WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.530
And the settlers themselves
look unmistakably modern,

2
00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:06.790
moving with purpose,
carrying the future with them.

3
00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:11.190
If the earlier images held Native figures
in a kind of timeless pause,

4
00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:16.410
these paintings give settlers dynamism,
motion, story, inheritance.

5
00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:19.710
By this point,
the contrast is impossible to miss.

6
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.510
The land appears empty.

7
00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:24.130
Indigenous people appear frozen in time.

8
00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:27.570
Settlers stride confidently
into a promised future.
